<title>CANADA: Toronto Sun buyout to create debt burden.</title>
<headline>Toronto Sun buyout to create debt burden.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The C$411 million management-led buyout of the Toronto Sun Publishing Corp will load the company with a hefty debt burden, observers said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Toronto Sun's board has recommended that shareholders accept the C$16 per share bid, the company said in a management information circular.</p>
<p>Rogers Communications Inc, the debt-laden cable television company which prompted the offer by putting its majority holding on the block in May, has already agreed to tender to the bid.</p>
